Computer Program : Sequence of Instructions that directs a computer what action to perform in an order.
Programming Lang : Language used to write that computer program 
Programming : The art of writing the Program
Executing : When computer performs the action described by set of instruction written in the program.
Hardware : Physiscal components like CPU, mouse, keyboard,storage devices, memory etc.
Software : Programs designed to be executed on the hardware.
Platform : Compatibility between hardware and software in single device.
Portable : when a program can run on different platform or CPU architecture it is called as portable.

Machine Language : It is the language in which the set of instructions are written to be understood byt the cpu.
Instruction set : Set of all possible machine language instructions that a CPU can understand.
Bit : It is the smallest unit in an instruction consist of only 0 and 1.
Assembly Language : It is typically a more higher level Language for the humans to understand machine Language.
                      e.g mov al, 0x61
Different set of CPU architecture family like the X86, Arm64 etc.
Low level Language : Includes Machine Language and Assembly Language 
                    because they provide minimal abstraction for comp. architecture.

               Disadvantages : Not Portable to other instruction set architecture.
                               Requires detailed knowledge of hardware architecture itself
                               Length of the Instructions is more for complex operations.


High Level Language : It is language in which the programmer writes their code which is then converted into machine language
Compiler : A program that converts High level source code into low level machine code. It generates an executable file that is run by the hardware to produce an output.
Interpreter : A program that converts the Instructions in the source code line by line directly into the machine code that can be run by the hardware.

Compiler applies code optimizations and number of analyses after converting the code into compiled version but it cannot detect dynamic optimizations.
Interpreter typically requires more time to execute the code and it has to be run again to generate the machine code.


Data is a piece of info that can be stored, processed and moved.
value is single piece of data.
Object represents a region of storage that can store the value.
Variable refers to the object with name.
Identifier refers to the name of the variable.
Data type is used to dictate what type of value the object holds.
